  "description": "Block-aware web scraping engine for .NET 9/10: request queue with priorities and de-duplication, retries with backoff, response checks (blocked, not found, cut-off pages), rotating http/socks proxies and user agents from a file or a URL with block policies, per-host throttling on 429/503, robots.txt, sitemaps, link depth, runs that resume after a crash, routing by page type or label with typed page data, async handlers and streamed results of any type. HTML is parsed with z3l.FastHtmlParser.",
